WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:49.416
In the previous verse, we saw how Arjun

2
00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:53.541
expressed the reality of Lord Krishna.

3
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:56.250
Now in these next verses,

4
00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:00.125
he sings from his heart of
Lord Krishna's unique supremacy.

5
00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:02.958
First, Arjun fully accepts the divine knowledge

6
00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:06.250
given by Lord Krishna,

7
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.458
and says

8
00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:08.875
that even the devas

9
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:11.208
and demons cannot
comprehend this knowledge.

10
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:12.750
Then in the next verse,

11
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:15.000
he glorifies Lord Krishna

12
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.041
through many sacred names.

13
00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.083
Arjun expresses his unwavering faith

14
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:29.083
in Lord Krishna's words, saying –

15
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:31.916
'sarvam etad ritam manye',

16
00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:35.333
meaning 'Everything You have said,

17
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:36.291
I accept

18
00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:39.416
as complete truth.'

19
00:01:39.416 --> 00:01:42.958
Arjun says this not out of blind belief,

20
00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:45.000
but because he has personally witnessed

21
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.208
Lord Krishna's divinity.

22
00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.916
Arjun acknowledges

23
00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:52.583
that Lord Krishna's divinity is so unique

24
00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:55.541
that even divine beings like devas and demons

25
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:58.708
cannot fully understand it.

26
00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:02.875
This humility presents an example for us.

27
00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:03.583
That is,

28
00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:04.958
to accept Lord Krishna's teachings,

29
00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.666
it is not necessary

30
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:11.541
to intellectually understand
every detail of them.

31
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.125
Some truths may remain

32
00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:15.291
beyond our current understanding,

33
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:17.958
requiring purification

34
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:21.083
and patience to realise.

35
00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:23.250
In the next verse, Arjun addresses Lord Krishna

36
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.708
with several elevated titles,

37
00:02:26.708 --> 00:02:28.583
each of these titles

38
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.833
revealing a unique aspect

39
00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:32.750
of His supremacy.

40
00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.708
He calls Lord Krishna 'Purushottama' –

41
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:36.708
the Supreme Person,

42
00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:37.958
showing

43
00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:40.583
that Lord Krishna is not only divine,

44
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:43.500
but the highest of all beings.

45
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.291
As 'Bhuta-bhavana',

46
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:48.000
Lord Krishna is the origin

47
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.958
and sustainer of all living beings.

48
00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:51.625
But being the source alone

49
00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:56.250
does not fully define His greatness.

50
00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.666
Arjun further glorifies Lord
Krishna as 'Bhutesha' –

51
00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:01.708
the supreme controller of all beings –

52
00:03:01.708 --> 00:03:03.208
and as 'Deva-deva' –

53
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:05.958
the God of all gods –

54
00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:09.375
which shows

55
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:13.166
that even the devas of heaven worship Him.

56
00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:16.375
Finally, Arjun calls Lord Krishna 'Jagat-pate' –

57
00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:19.375
the master and protector of the world,

58
00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:21.250
who is responsible

59
00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.791
for guiding and sustaining all creation.

60
00:03:24.791 --> 00:03:26.416
Arjun acknowledges

61
00:03:26.416 --> 00:03:28.166
that only Lord Krishna Himself

62
00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:30.750
can truly know Himself.

63
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.250
This self-knowledge arises from His inner power

64
00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.958
or svarupa-shakti,

65
00:03:35.958 --> 00:03:40.083
which is beyond the reach of ordinary intellect.

66
00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:43.000
By humbly glorifying Lord Krishna,

67
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.500
Arjun not only expresses his devotion,

68
00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:50.125
but also teaches us the
importance of recognising and accepting

69
00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:55.541
the divine knowledge of
the Bhagavad Gita as it is.

70
00:03:55.541 --> 00:03:56.583
Arjun's declaration

71
00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:58.166
reminds us

72
00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:00.333
that humility and devotion

73
00:04:00.333 --> 00:04:01.916
toward Lord Krishna and surrender

74
00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:06.000
are the keys to understanding spiritual truths.

75
00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.791
Through this surrender, Lord Krishna

76
00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:11.958
reveals Himself before us,

77
00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:13.583
just as He

78
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:16.875
revealed Himself before Arjun.

79
00:04:21.208 --> 00:04:24.916
Walking on the path of life,

80
00:04:24.916 --> 00:04:26.541
how often

81
00:04:26.541 --> 00:04:29.750
do you choose only what

82
00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:34.500
appeals to your own mind?

83
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.958
There is a vast

84
00:04:35.958 --> 00:04:38.708
treasure of knowledge

85
00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.000
in this creation.

86
00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.833
To pick only certain gems of knowledge

87
00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:48.291
according to the wishes of one's own mind

88
00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:52.208
is the natural tendency of human beings.

89
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.416
But

90
00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:56.750
the doorway to true progress

91
00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.791
opens when

92
00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:03.208
you, with humility and openness,

93
00:05:03.208 --> 00:05:08.250
absorb complete knowledge.

94
00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.166
The way

95
00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:12.208
Arjun accepted My every

96
00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:16.458
word from his heart

97
00:05:16.458 --> 00:05:18.250
is an excellent

98
00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.958
example for you.

99
00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:24.541
He did not say

100
00:05:24.541 --> 00:05:27.375
'This part I like'

101
00:05:27.375 --> 00:05:32.875
or 'That part I cannot accept.'

102
00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:38.333
He received the complete knowledge,

103
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:40.833
even that

104
00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:46.208
which he did not immediately understand.

105
00:05:46.208 --> 00:05:49.083
He believed this knowledge

106
00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:50.041
in the future

107
00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:53.541
could certainly prove very useful.

108
00:05:53.541 --> 00:05:56.625
When in your life

109
00:05:56.625 --> 00:05:57.875
you receive

110
00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:01.916
any positive knowledge,

111
00:06:01.916 --> 00:06:05.875
embrace it fully,

112
00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:10.208
not just what is convenient.

113
00:06:10.208 --> 00:06:13.666
Yes, this does not mean

114
00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:17.333
that we become blind believers.

115
00:06:17.333 --> 00:06:20.875
Ask questions like Arjun,

116
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:24.958
and once all doubts are cleared,

117
00:06:24.958 --> 00:06:28.791
accept the knowledge completely.

118
00:06:28.791 --> 00:06:30.708
Think about this –

119
00:06:30.708 --> 00:06:34.250
when you go to a doctor,

120
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.791
do you follow their advice

121
00:06:36.791 --> 00:06:41.333
fully or only partially?

122
00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:44.458
If they suggest medicine, exercise,

123
00:06:44.458 --> 00:06:48.625
and a change in diet,

124
00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:51.416
do you only take the medicine

125
00:06:51.416 --> 00:06:54.666
and ignore the exercise and
the dietary restrictions?

126
00:06:54.666 --> 00:06:56.666
Doing this,

127
00:06:56.666 --> 00:06:59.750
can you become healthy?

128
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.375
Never.

129
00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:03.583
Sometimes

130
00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:06.708
the most difficult truth shows the path

131
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:11.000
to the deepest change.

132
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.208
The ideas

133
00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:16.166
that make you most uncomfortable

134
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:21.250
may bring you the most growth.

135
00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.875
Just as

136
00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:27.708
gold is purified only by passing through fire,

137
00:07:27.708 --> 00:07:32.541
in the same way, only by passing
through challenging truths

138
00:07:32.541 --> 00:07:36.083
does the soul's true growth happen.

139
00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:38.791
Keep your mind open.

140
00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:42.791
See truth not in fragments,

141
00:07:42.791 --> 00:07:46.458
but in its wholeness.

142
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:49.833
You will find that as

143
00:07:49.833 --> 00:07:53.750
you absorb complete knowledge,

144
00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.208
your perspective will expand,

145
00:07:57.208 --> 00:08:00.625
your understanding will deepen,

146
00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:05.166
and your life will become more balanced.

147
00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.166
In society, it is often seen

148
00:08:13.166 --> 00:08:15.791
that people use spiritual knowledge

149
00:08:15.791 --> 00:08:18.583
selectively.

150
00:08:18.583 --> 00:08:22.125
They go to temples, perform worship,

151
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:25.375
but do not bring into their own conduct

152
00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:27.083
those principles

153
00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:33.166
which they resolve to follow during prayer.

154
00:08:33.166 --> 00:08:35.125
This is like

155
00:08:35.125 --> 00:08:39.541
wanting to eat the fruit of a tree

156
00:08:39.541 --> 00:08:43.416
but not caring for its roots.

157
00:08:43.416 --> 00:08:46.291
See Arjun's devotion.

158
00:08:46.291 --> 00:08:49.791
He believed in My teachings.

159
00:08:49.791 --> 00:08:51.500
Not only that,

160
00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.916
he also brought them into his life.

161
00:08:55.916 --> 00:08:58.583
For him, faith

162
00:08:58.583 --> 00:09:02.250
and the conduct that follows from faith

163
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.500
were two sides

164
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.041
of the same coin.

165
00:09:08.041 --> 00:09:12.375
The same principle applies in the family.

166
00:09:12.375 --> 00:09:16.000
When parents teach their children

167
00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.083
'Speak the truth,' but

168
00:09:19.083 --> 00:09:23.416
they themselves tell small lies,

169
00:09:23.416 --> 00:09:25.708
they are unknowingly

170
00:09:25.708 --> 00:09:31.375
teaching a contradiction.

171
00:09:31.375 --> 00:09:34.833
Children learn what they see,

172
00:09:34.833 --> 00:09:38.666
not what they are told.

173
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:42.041
True spirituality is that

174
00:09:42.041 --> 00:09:45.500
which is reflected in your every breath,

175
00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:51.208
in every action, in every thought.

176
00:09:51.208 --> 00:09:53.708
If ever there is discomfort

177
00:09:53.708 --> 00:09:58.458
or difficulty in adopting a spiritual way of life,

178
00:09:58.458 --> 00:09:59.583
even then

179
00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:04.375
one must walk this path with full faith.

180
00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:08.375
No thought of any other option should arise.

181
00:10:08.375 --> 00:10:11.583
When your family and those in your community

182
00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:15.541
see you living with patience, compassion,

183
00:10:15.541 --> 00:10:18.666
and sacrifice – such spiritual values –

184
00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:20.583
they too

185
00:10:20.583 --> 00:10:22.750
are inspired

186
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:26.333
to adopt these values.

187
00:10:26.333 --> 00:10:28.416
This is the most powerful path

188
00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:34.125
to transformation of heart in family and society.

189
00:10:34.125 --> 00:10:36.750
Do not only speak the truth,

190
00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.166
live the truth in truth.

191
00:10:40.166 --> 00:10:45.291
Through wholesome actions,
inspire everyone around you.

192
00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.833
Knowledge

193
00:10:51.833 --> 00:10:54.791
is infinite.

194
00:10:54.791 --> 00:10:56.375
However great

195
00:10:56.375 --> 00:11:00.666
an expert you may become,

196
00:11:00.666 --> 00:11:02.458
yet still

197
00:11:02.458 --> 00:11:07.541
much remains to be learned.

198
00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:12.291
In the field of work, the art of leadership

199
00:11:12.291 --> 00:11:13.791
is complete only through

200
00:11:13.791 --> 00:11:18.041
the union of skill and humility.

201
00:11:18.041 --> 00:11:20.250
Just as clouds,

202
00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:24.583
the more water they carry,

203
00:11:24.583 --> 00:11:28.291
the lower they bow,

204
00:11:28.291 --> 00:11:30.166
in the same way,

205
00:11:30.166 --> 00:11:33.000
the richness of knowledge

206
00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.541
brings humility.

207
00:11:36.541 --> 00:11:38.458
Arjun

208
00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:43.250
was unmatched in the art of archery.

209
00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:45.000
Yet still

210
00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:49.958
he readily accepted

211
00:11:49.958 --> 00:11:52.416
that My complete knowledge

212
00:11:52.416 --> 00:11:56.083
was beyond his understanding.

213
00:11:56.083 --> 00:12:01.041
He acknowledged that even the greatest beings

214
00:12:01.041 --> 00:12:02.875
cannot fully grasp

215
00:12:02.875 --> 00:12:06.750
the divine.

216
00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:11.458
Being humble did not diminish his greatness.

217
00:12:11.458 --> 00:12:18.875
Rather, it made his personality shine even brighter.

218
00:12:18.875 --> 00:12:20.750
As a leader,

219
00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:23.541
your expertise

220
00:12:23.541 --> 00:12:27.875
is your most valuable quality.

221
00:12:27.875 --> 00:12:29.791
It is this that earns you

222
00:12:29.791 --> 00:12:32.750
trust and respect.

223
00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:36.208
But true greatness comes

224
00:12:36.208 --> 00:12:39.958
when you can accept,

225
00:12:39.958 --> 00:12:41.416
saying,

226
00:12:41.416 --> 00:12:46.416
'I do not have the answer to every question.'

227
00:12:46.416 --> 00:12:48.833
Think about it – a manager

228
00:12:48.833 --> 00:12:51.791
on a complex project

229
00:12:51.791 --> 00:12:55.166
accepts their limitations

230
00:12:55.166 --> 00:12:59.333
and asks the team for suggestions.

231
00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:00.875
The result?

232
00:13:00.875 --> 00:13:02.291
New ideas

233
00:13:02.291 --> 00:13:04.500
emerge

234
00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:08.125
and the team's confidence grows.

235
00:13:08.125 --> 00:13:11.875
When suggestions are asked for,

236
00:13:11.875 --> 00:13:14.208
people feel themselves

237
00:13:14.208 --> 00:13:17.625
valued and respected.

238
00:13:17.625 --> 00:13:22.791
They are encouraged to share their thoughts.

239
00:13:22.791 --> 00:13:26.541
The combination of skill and humility

240
00:13:26.541 --> 00:13:31.708
builds a balanced leadership.
